  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "辛味が　強い　調味料。ホースラディッシュと　近い　味わいで風味が　素晴らしい　調味料。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "매운맛이 강한 조미료. 호스래디시와 비슷한 맛에 풍미가 뛰어난 조미료다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辣味強勁的調味料。滋味近似辣根，風味絕佳。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment au goût très épicé. Bien que son goût soit similaire à celui du raifort, sa saveur est subtilement distincte.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses sehr scharfe Würzmittel ähnelt zwar normalem Meerrettich, besitzt jedoch ein außergewöhnliches und unverwechselbares Aroma.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Parecido al rábano picante, este condimento es también muy picante y aporta un aroma exquisito a cualquier bocadillo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto piccante. Di sapore simile al Rafano, è un condimento dal gusto sublime.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This very spicy condiment seems close to horseradish at first, but you’ll find that it has a superb flavor all its own.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辛味が　強い　調味料。ホースラディッシュと　近い　味わいで風味が　素晴らしい　調味料。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辣味强烈的调味料。是一款风味与辣根相似的优秀调味料。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
